\tr{\td{the default set, cap 4 MiB}\td{0.85 / 5.58}\td{1.62 / 10.84}\td{0.52 / 2.61}\td{0.67 / 1.62}\td{2.46 / 14.92}\td{30.26 / 212.2}}
\tr{\td{default set / \code{\verb~|warm,gated,expect~}, CPU}\td{-26 \%}\td{-20 \%}\td{-20 \%}\td{-78 \%}\td{-19 \%}\td{-5 \%}}
}

\p{Two more readings of the default set in window \code{\verb~|w4~} (interleaved with the H10 image): Init 0.84, 0.81 s / 5.38, 5.37 s CPU; Std 1.52, 1.51 / 10.23, 10.19; Cedar slice 0.46, 0.46 / 2.50, 2.51; reachability 0.61, 0.58 / 1.60, 1.55; cedar 2.06, 2.11 / 14.01, 14.25: the rows above repeat to 2-4 \% in CPU. The table of the final distribution against the reference engine, gruszka, nano-lean and the official checker is \src{docs/BENCHMARKS.md}.}
}
}

\subtree{
\title{Named switches}

\table{
\tr{\th{Name}\th{Bit}\th{Owner}\th{What it turns on}\th{State}\th{Evidence}}
\tr{\td{\code{\verb~|gated~}}\td{0 \code{\verb~|SW_GATED_TABLING~}}\td{M2}\td{EVAL tables a node only if its flags say it is shared, a binder body or invariant, or it lies 4+ inert levels below its nest root (off: every non-leaf node is tabled)}\td{\strong{ON by default} (16:24Z)}\td{part of step 1; the quadratic cliff on unshared dependent nests is fixed (NOTES-M2 D21: 4,000 levels 8,038,031 -> 60,017 ticks)}}
\tr{\td{\code{\verb~|pchk~}}\td{1 \code{\verb~|SW_PCHK~}}\td{M5}\td{shared check facts: a closed, level-parameter-free export term that passed check mode is inferred in ONLY mode by later declarations and workers (never after an eager-reduction comparison)}\td{\strong{ON by default} (wave-6 integration)}\td{M5: -1.5 to -1.8 \% instructions on Init / Std alone, -3.7 / -4.3 \% with \code{\verb~|match,joint~}; 9,110 tutorial mutants 0 / 0; the gates above}}
